  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogLines:
  - Greetings, Wizard...
  - I am enbrightened by your arrival.
  - I have found myself in a period of darkness...
  - You see... there is a prescence of gloom stalking me...
  - In this cave... lies a dark crawler.
  - To escape, we must avoid it at all costs.
  - Wizard! You have illuminated me with an idea!
  - I will lend you my beam... and with it, you can guide us both to safety.
  DialogAudio:
